Evidence taken is from D-Zone (Astral Reign rules).
In the first example, Unfettered Mirth drew "Sticky Wax" & "Madness" but did not deal any extra instances of DMG (3 total);
In the second example, Unfettered Mirth drew "Telekinesis" and dealt 3 extra instances of DMG (6 total).

Right, but the description is horrendously wrong then? Because on the first try, I should have dealt 9 instances of DMG;
1 from Base, 1 from drawing a State Card, 1 from drawing a Symptom Card;
(1+1+1) ×3 = 9
